# 9 Oct 2026: every text file is checked out with LF. Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true,
# which rewrote the HTML/JS/Python files with CRLF on a branch switch; the JS harnesses read the
# files raw and their multi-line regexes expect LF, so 31 assertions failed on a clean tree.
# Render runs Linux and there is no build step: LF everywhere is the only sane state.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.db binary
